      <div class="q-section-hdr">
        <h3>Questions 1–3 · Note Completion</h3>
        <p>Choose <b>NO MORE THAN ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER</b> from the passage for each answer. Write your answers in boxes 1–3.</p>
